{"4512340": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Headshot Holdout", "steam_appid": 4512340, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Reap Death's Enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Annihilate waves of zombies as you descend through sets of hand-authored arenas to rescue Death himself from the Nazi's clutches.﻿﻿ Every shot counts as you strive to survive the onslaught, and earn the top GORE.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Coordinate Brutality</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together with your team, syncing up your shots, powers, and positions to achieve the highest GORE on the worldwide leaderboards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Scale Your Build </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your character by building a headshot streak and acquiring strange and powerful gifts from Death that change each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Slay Creatively</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each arena is an immersive playground; blow barrels up, drop chandeliers, kick your enemies into acid pools and more. Creative play wins the day!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Increase the Challenge</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock augments after successful runs, stacking the deck against your squad and allowing for even greater HIGH GORES.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Reap Death's Enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Annihilate waves of zombies as you descend through sets of hand-authored arenas to rescue Death himself from the Nazi's clutches.﻿﻿ Every shot counts as you strive to survive the onslaught, and earn the top GORE.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Coordinate Brutality</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together with your team, syncing up your shots, powers, and positions to achieve the highest GORE on the worldwide leaderboards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Scale Your Build </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your character by building a headshot streak and acquiring strange and powerful gifts from Death that change each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Slay Creatively</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each arena is an immersive playground; blow barrels up, drop chandeliers, kick your enemies into acid pools and more. Creative play wins the day!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Increase the Challenge</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock augments after successful runs, stacking the deck against your squad and allowing for even greater HIGH GORES.</p>", "short_description": "Headshot Holdout is a retro styled co-op shooter where squads of 1-4 players slaughter their way across a hand-authored, zombie infested stronghold on a quest to rescue DEATH itself.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512340/5b763e803ca99fefe4eac77eea93fea09882b0df/header.jpg?t=1787704380", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512340/9758f96179a792e7f09ae200bf8b4d1d517e4cef/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787704380", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512340/9758f96179a792e7f09ae200bf8b4d1d517e4cef/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787704380", "website": "https://headshotholdout.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><